WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER
This project displays content it does not own, and claims no rights to it:

- All show listings (bands, dates, venues, addresses) are from the public
  Ventura Rocks calendar (venturarocks.com).
- Artist photos and 30-second previews are streamed from Deezer under
  Deezer's own terms. None are stored in this repository.
- Band names, venue names, and any trademarks belong to their owners.
  Their appearance here does not mean they endorse or are affiliated
  with this project.
